    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Cats of Shanghai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through vibrant Shanghai, searching for playful cats hidden in the Bund, traditional lane houses (longtang), and bustling night markets. Can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:<br>\u2022 Over 100 unique cats waiting to be discovered<br>\u2022 Beautiful AI-generated Shanghai scenes, from the Huangpu River to classic Shikumen architecture<br>\u2022 Relaxing soundtrack inspired by Jiangnan traditional music<br>\u2022 Perfect for short breaks - find a few cats, save your progress, and return anytime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from daily life with this casual hidden object game. Each cat has its own personality and hiding style, making every discovery a delightful surprise.</p>",
